      "natural_statement": "For the stated composite coprime fixed-determinant spaces, P_k H^m(X,Q)=W_(2k) H^m(X^B,Q)=W_(2k+1) H^m(X^B,Q) for all k,m under nonabelian Hodge, on full cohomology.",
      "formal_statement": "",
