      "natural_statement": "On the same full cohomology there exists a degree -2 operator f with fP_k subset P_(k-2), fW_j subset W_(j-4), and [[f,e],e]=-2e, compatible with the logarithmic restriction, moving-pole translation and Hitchin-base specialization identifications.",
